<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Thomson cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Thomson cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut Thomson Corp to a neutral from an outperform on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at C$31.05 on the Toronto Stock Exchange on Tuesday.</p>
